The files are changed from the originals: each was converted from Ogg
Vorbis to a 16 kHz mono mu-law WAV file, cut to one period of the sound
(Argon to the first of its two phrases, with a fade at the end), and
changed in level.  The originals are in the repository
https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base, directory
data/sounds, at commit 1cdfff555f4a21f71ccc978290e2e212e2f8b168:

  beep.wav     Alarm_Beep_03.ogg
  buzzer.wav   Alarm_Buzzer.ogg
  classic.wav  Alarm_Classic.ogg
  osmium.wav   alarms/ogg/Osmium.ogg
  rooster.wav  Alarm_Rooster_02.ogg
  argon.wav    alarms/ogg/Argon.ogg

